WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.706
Teaching small shopping

00:00:01.517 --> 00:00:02.708
agents with real

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.510
purchase data

00:00:04.038 --> 00:00:05.582
Criteo AI Lab

00:00:05.406 --> 00:00:06.773
released RecoATLAS

00:00:06.927 --> 00:00:08.106
an open environment

00:00:08.236 --> 00:00:09.250
a paper and

00:00:09.097 --> 00:00:10.724
a RecSys 2026

00:00:10.536 --> 00:00:11.420
tutorial

00:00:11.597 --> 00:00:12.681
after six months

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:13.247
of work

00:00:13.774 --> 00:00:14.870
It turns logged

00:00:14.682 --> 00:00:16.049
bandit feedback from

00:00:15.861 --> 00:00:17.052
real purchases into

00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:18.196
tasks for training

00:00:18.008 --> 00:00:19.340
recommendation agents

00:00:19.399 --> 00:00:20.554
with reinforcement

00:00:20.366 --> 00:00:20.991
learning

00:00:21.518 --> 00:00:22.579
The release covers

00:00:22.391 --> 00:00:23.263
the design

00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:24.489
benchmarks and their

00:00:24.301 --> 00:00:25.727
results training small

00:00:25.928 --> 00:00:27.532
specialized orchestrators

00:00:27.343 --> 00:00:29.183
to coordinate recommendations

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:30.477
The environment code

00:00:30.289 --> 00:00:31.090
is open

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.199
so others can

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.036
train their own

00:00:33.558 --> 00:00:34.572
Full story on

00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:35.279
the dashboard
